version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-27"
abstract: >-
  Python reference implementation of a state-machine contract for externally
  authorized updates to a 32-slot state vector: short-lived, payload-bound
  Ed25519 capabilities verified against public keys, independent dual approval
  for calibration, a max-absolute residual latch (ADR-001 rule, strict > tau),
  EVEN/ODD/FOLD8 symmetry sectors, and a bounded audit ring. Research software;
  SYNTHETIC test inputs; not certified safety software.
keywords:
  - oes32
  - state-machine
  - ed25519
  - capabilities
  - dual-control
  - research-software
